LBS^2 PYTHON PORT - LICENSE
===============================================================================

This project is a Python port of LBS^2 v2.0.304. It is distributed under the
same terms as the original software, reproduced verbatim below, and it keeps the
original copyright notice and attribution as those terms require.

Portions of this repository were taken from LBS^2:

  - frontend/styles/**            (the three themes, including their images)
  - frontend/js/common.js
  - frontend/js/messageform.js

Everything else (the Flask + SQLite backend, the JavaScript application layer,
the page skeletons and the English strings ported from the original language
files) is new work for the port. See NOTICE for the full attribution.


